// Chapter intro and outro barks — one node per chapter + direction

title: retreat_intro
---
Hold the line. Buy time for the withdrawal!
We cannot advance. Not yet. Hold.
Brace for attack!
Prepare yourself, they are coming.
Defensive posture. Every second counts.
===

title: retreat_outro
---
We survived. For now.
So many ships lost...
We won't survive another onslaught like that.
We bought time. Use it well.
===

title: assault_intro
---
Press the attack. No hesitation.
Forward. All forces, advance!
We strike now while they are exposed.
===

title: assault_outro
---
The system is ours!
Another front secured!
Victory!
They could not stop us.
===

title: skirmish_intro
---
This sector is ours.
Neither side controls this space. That changes now.
Probe their defenses. Find the weakness.
We must secure this system.
===

title: skirmish_outro
---
The sector is cleared!
We control this space now.
Contested no more...
Victory!
===

title: conquest_intro
---
Leave nothing standing. Every system, every fleet.
This ends now. Total annihilation.
No quarter. No retreat. Finish it.
===

title: conquest_outro
---
Total victory. The stars are ours.
Nothing remains to oppose us.
The galaxy belongs to us now.
===
